        "1026",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b3f2d4928b6b6a4a4a7f053",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『表达感谢』…已设定为目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54589c6f3f1bccbef047dd1cbb0ad06a817d24f6cf20761e51b9300d288e601b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77eee8ded88afd7a8d15cf21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请下命令，主人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5816a06e6d8c2d28fc6d5b3a9e3ae484efc3e168a77368e18f385ace66c54ab7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:360bd122da6e01a7dd0f6e43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与主人的相遇，\n已作为重要数据\n好好地保存在记忆中了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "613bf4767b6de86a8eb2961af02bc72e2630f230d5e8b31561df8cb91c18ba2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:990a3c8d480dbef0819d4ca3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服…\n在功能性上我并没有感觉到有问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2cff0a345a87465e0f7002acb2b4d19d87434c1298e7ed7c4fc14deb7906f98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46a61c33cab285c682d179ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "素材、可动范围、设计…综合下来判断为\n适宜在LIVE中穿着的服装。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fc6bc2eaea07f3882bda65f838d28363335bb703899cddf89d1c46ab7ec62d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1944790ed3777f76ee487ef0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…感知到状态『高涨』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e8817db1be1d060921ab9a2ab0c28d3dad07c99d309f9275c503db3d7721a5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dcad131b89d67cf090750d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "第一次穿的时候…父亲\n夸奖说『很适合你』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d644efec989f08c3b3aa98f384b8a8ef4b123a2a7d9d1e161b6df566ce8e0cdb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6553ef782696f34d7640274",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "LIVE目的『感谢』…\n已输入。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4116aa2d4c465a026878b4d289d580ab63b8803655f7c1064c4182cf4d151963",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:022c49d6fa00b9873304b7fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有比这件\n更合身的衣服了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5dfdb4969eefcdfdcd267cb56c4385ff815410b800e09cd23eb42bca9d956aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:283e9290e1cb1658b212b856",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正在学习甜品的制作过程。\n希望能在补充糖分时有所帮助。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1acd4e1d8376c831b4c4fab44a135e168933b9d92ec6596a9a68ab1b5ab4874",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0e9ee59aad82c6bfba15b42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然这是以蛋糕为原型的衣服，\n但不可以食用。请多加注意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76e885954e4aa9ec686b6834175ee342db3b7a407f656d8c7c35cb8495f81789",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:465349c1e80d54262c0118b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "分析中……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1d3c07113c1fa4bcb07655a73265ca52fd4a3150357ada2d48e119cef263fc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d07c1d7d60fa3912e7f2c0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "执行命令，获胜",
      "source_fingerprint": "f878a7c9393f2cbb686274470ad90a5884f5e8cdecaac91bd8abf58336358a3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ae427558c2d682f68a7e12b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "切换到休假模式。",
      "source_fingerprint": "715a4f860cee2e5a709961aebee470bf1fd551783c9bb1b7a5a504d60a5aeb09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d82eb1dd7136c934bb05fab8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我认为休养也是比赛必备的要素。\r\n教练，我们执行吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e1855533022eca5d56248c34b9cb354b5cd258885f393e49fe7ed7613262006",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
