        "1026",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80cb4d67b0841e7d6ca76c55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お疲れ様です",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba6d317ce3a2bfaf3d87ba426113b0a3498828395ba8d093265eb3539b78c491",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5bfe1ae98dc0a0885a4b845",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "确认到状态『兴趣』。\n我已经准备完毕了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4d5e7e386a13e26c53580db31023403adcd72febf3adb9191a9e7000458f636",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:161a14405022ea526bd2a4fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "解除安全锁。\n…现在才是正式开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "223d3409539e29b2a8c92197b9775fb8419338b404fb35adf65c2ba0c7960852",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b93249af6da2f949925ce0f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好，主人。\n今天从什么开始呢。\n无论是什么，请先下指令。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cae89f20e5326a4b2cbc53a0f86e72b052085673ba11a917cc53fb3c16a9f9df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e2887e710da06c7324bb870",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昨晚的睡眠效率、今天早上的行为\n均无异常。综合起来看…\n我今天很『精神』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e45bcf07589b7e11e71b36c3487a1e6e62599822472a4a80fde6e29aca83c2b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0a98fcfadd4cc1e41c37a99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "时钟显示为下午。另外，我的\n活动能量已补充完毕。\n…嗝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d6a28393c81296bacf8ff82398f93324c6963d300029ab04e53a11bd65eab91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c7cbff17daf0d0f904c404d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请允许我谢罪。\n确认到电热水壶发生故障…\n饭后茶的预定已取消。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d775d8bce5b78db853b0cc33bdbd873de76250e2a630b14ca3108448422db5b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88d736e9aaa536d4bbbc1c62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你叫我吗，主人。\n请放心。就算到晚上，\n我也在待机模式运行中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2104aa757cea42c31957b7ac287578731d37f06de3ee7cc1bbe38b94b87e0d1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2efd9bf31d06ffee618f6520",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "未经许可的夜间训练\n已被禁止。\n…感情抑制中。等待早上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23d5bf5d1f48e1359ef29f2ebafe8a883f1e9bca9a132c17109f8e844624a8a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71ecc7597d0ebe373a64d69c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…被新生喊了『前辈』\n我一时没反应过来。\n最优解应该是什么呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f8a1375b91581b1e15d8f4cf0f1e228bae39f114d08e8c1081a42b0c5efed3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:611e68a2b58c13af7bc13b46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "高温下运动发生故障风险高。\n判断为紧急事态必须采取夏季对策。\n整备专用流程吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edccdea84ef33548508a3d5dc1b585e4cce86a99b2146e6154424768ea271d31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:736b1b40fc0426162495365e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海鲜、野菜、肉…食欲之秋。\n状态变为『空腹』的可能性大\n…这是很危险的季节，主人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93be8f1d71aab42ccb0662a86935652afecd62d3878d622597d900894bea923b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fe7cf3af19eb14dc30a0871",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在整备前的坡路上确认到霜。\n根据其声音和触感…\n感知到了『冬天的乐趣』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6461fb7c4a747dffc45259e38c9443019df9b472f92dacc8c0d395fdac371b50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:464b10dead515f7e2c366701",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早餐的草莓及谷物\n能量已补充完毕。\n随时可以开始活动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63e4612a959973df3652c60b4c8f9e30fcde5558e67b452b9bd6ce6ddb6c07da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dee139dfbf7dfa44a2d2082d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "休息时间外的『不甜』\n菜单已设定完毕。\n换言之，和平时相同。",
      "source_fingerprint": "008ceeebf1be82ddfb611d475ca2ec1fbc5715eaffec58c9b6cad82847595cba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59cc4b89cc73e7bf9995ec8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "糖分还充足吗？有需要\n的话我可以根据主人的身体数据\n算出您每日的需求量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58f692d7466f1b2e763fa319553bb4b3c0e092e60baa7020ec576e601274134d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71e8a4a80455152d718a8348",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感知到周围的甜品气息。\n判断为『点心时间』。主人，\n吃些点心怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b7e7a1c8ad90d3fcc28ca4ba8ce29f08e84b2a704b8f2004374b176a50291dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c967ab76b923f0fa129f91d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "根据时间推测为『熬夜』。\n一定时间后将自动进入\n待机模式。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c41bcf5c2514c1ca6a80f1fb58cb7cb67731ba43967b5a13cb4610784670e00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:222989c3c6e29aadd85898ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正在研究如何帮助主人…\n我提议准备热巧克力\n作为夜宵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb77d09b8810cff8619ef096c26141f96e234bbbd4b9b0bb6a84571a55686b40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f12bcc39898311ad0d90f591",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到了进王同学亲手做的樱花饼\n虽然外形不太好看，\n但不知为何能感到『可爱』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9405fc800e10752eab31d70956d71bf776ceecfac93ec162dae4e3f15902be07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae0ed7fab0d3bb624f700d6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冰淇淋和果冻…虽然相当\n『美味』，但是很凉。\n对腹部可能有危害。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8033f19a4ace6d046de8d0cf02cedbe34073aa676b969c71dca397ce4a168f8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77bfb38cdc058a1275aeb19a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃栗子蛋糕的时候，\n麦昆同学飞快地逃开了…\n她怎么了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e2548e01e0302458a10288a033e13b7d0a34a4ec6f254dbf525b03015b14f0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:261a4fb8a46793b0bce72b9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望能给父母送上我亲手做的巧\n克力。我想在下次回家时把\n平日的『感谢』传达给他们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a45f61d170a1ab9ad21e6cbbf19a3d98a9fcc3318ae3558a0760913f59d00a66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f97d5dced4408ccd6138214a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c099b96d5b567ff6bb60410e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00940a6929b351384845e7f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "父亲原本是训练员，他为实现\n我的梦想而尽心尽力。\n我从心底里信赖父亲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33ff5c74e4eca0b06149363b214652693a8cc841535f1b625a018b44d83ea851",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4fb1a785da0b546cea81bd7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天早上，醒目飞鹰\n有一场关于马娘偶像的讲解。\n…『可爱』的定义好复杂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34dbf992bf09cf50ce1101ddf4f411c350b669d89f69e2576bfb7271d967d36c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:015ef220e74171b1f8c0b99f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴因为没能很好地\n接上话来跟我道歉了。\n…哪里有问题了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a4b0733b83200baba8d40e5e1a738636770b924253867a0260d7e677dacf0fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d6d2147fd487dab572d712d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "西野花经常在房间里\n装饰鲜花…我看了之后\n很不可思议地心情『安定』了下来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c494325d9325f5fa79f8148f7e5556f3fe94d308234ca73463f3cd02e920adea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8325977fcd22a215d6e605f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前几天，从樱花进王那\n收到了慰问品。\n主人也想要吗？电池。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bed3fef41b2e1e15dee3232e271d43cbf58dfb33e4fbadf6c0b561ea847043ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9ef1a22248fbd19899eef33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向粉丝表达感谢…\n是对三冠赛马娘来说所必要的\n指令吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea31e6b74b8a0bb82ff6ab48f9bdb3b0fc27ff74f24ab2638863934a85f13568",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:656c81ad5c1957fddd86fb6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舞蹈数据输入完毕。\n之后仅需下达指令\n我就能展现出完美的表演。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cffba2e06ce18c06989652579588d441224f2e5e9b13dbf86c731be5ae411217",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca0fafa7d0c6887477799c27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上决胜服…即为参加ＧＩ比赛。\n判断得到了一定的评价。\n为了实现梦想，我会继续努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffb98360356f975d72d49703b045bd240f83fdb5daa5d7b0201feb718acce079",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ab6bddf99b19ff0582df222",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服的绽线处和伤痕是代表着\n我所走过道路的备份。也是保存与主人\n之间回忆的媒介之一。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d5f19258f431bc84d0227731df164a656bc9e5da811cee55e6a1378147eb728",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:823191ebaf3933283211b67f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上推荐吃苹果。\n酸味，甜味、那种形状。\n不就是『完美』吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74744ffb874573199bfba685ef30e6eba3407f7291cfbc52c5595ccbad963da9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b4d8db92d42b6433fe64332",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼…啊…主人，\n要进入早餐后的\n睡眠模式吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e02480f0b3a56aae5f8922a251704e3a9d0bc1b2ae581cf605cf71b01c0d5848",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02cf2ad40c725815843064b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "主人，还在工作吗？\n如果有我能帮上忙的，\n请也给我下达指示。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a7208fd3ebd90749334df60fd4a6e1c9d10dda7587d8f9407d5d7bb67d91349",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47bd047d0b417e649316cae2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "由于被拜托去抢赏花位置，从前几天开始\n就一直在等，却被大家\n批评了…为什么呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2aed77c0bb7771b48b0ebbd15de2a9678bbf58893dff14e6607cea4109ed606",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c8d9d92e1b29e04eb37e9cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很擅长打西瓜。\n毕竟只要遵从指示\n就能打到了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9da442c3d4cfb2ac81170a418e6902655759ce3b66d501ad48a4f71725cb0ed0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96050418fb915c40141403e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才被罩在篝火的烟里了…\n要是我身体上有风扇的话，\n就能把它吹走了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebc2ce03c90c39473d47bdc356cbfc4bf055f358882f87f0bc2b860f81e78187",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fee63f859a927cdf89dbebb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冷天里喝波旁威士忌据说很不错。\n虽然我没喝过…但我问了父亲能不能\n送给主人一些。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9f4cec752f5c1a7c1d39758ea8bc08b3a79143fb170570c2a2d89681e224da9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ddf64b58f9145c5334f6c16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从闪耀同学的言行能够感觉到\n『正确性』和『敬意』。\n因此判断她是值得『信赖』的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddb920cb7111d16719c09f1e999cb7233241fd568e1c4c2baa12613ba37dd038",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28c07b1d9d8dd2a2f08a7c98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正在研究『アガる』的意义。\n待理解之后，考虑接受\n佐敦同学的美甲提议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c78a3854d257b528fa0041498c0c78678fe9c8e78239ebe90b4474e45fdae3b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7587959dcae53b492853df3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制作点心需要机器。也就是说\n以我的性质来看，需要协助者。\n…主人，可以请您帮忙吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d78a8ee1c985c599b45c06917c4901f6bc09f9824a2efc24ef7964d3f4fa5088",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22c951f0cdfcc26a8c55f964",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "指针计时器不如数字计时器\n准确。但认知度更高。\n也就是说『还不错』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "adf14a1133d9017d685a0f58ee7b1f36416d2efedf4646aaa5e724fd4dc35318",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f42ffd91debc1722d62e119a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正在思考食玩的问题…\n『点心』和『玩具』，哪个才是\n主要部分呢…好难的问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94d02656791f4927b25357f584eb7bd6e695211e08eb2e846c25dde4e4ce28c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91020"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
